  "description": "Taehee is the governor's demure daughter during the day and a merciless dominatrix at night. When the lustful ghost king threatens to keep seducing the women in the village unless he's offered a maiden as his bride, Taehee acts as bait to take him down. With the help of a famous exorcist and her own experiences conquering men, she thinks she'll get a good crack at punishing her arrogant husband. But once they're dragged into the world of ghosts, a rocky path lies ahead of them. Will Taehee's determination and spicy expertise be enough to defeat her enemy?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/oh_nanggun), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/ohmynanggunnim)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/how-to-punish-your-ghost-husband-m)",
